From d3fffd07b92e92984ef55b89a03053499f95b428 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: alechurri <337117637+alechurri@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 20:38:33 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 28/31] ORBIS: fastmem - guest address space view aliasing the
 lazy backing

16 KiB view pages map the backing on first touch when their four guest pages are consecutive
and readable; other faults go to dynarmic's slow path through a PS4 exception handler. A
startup self-test (aliasing, mprotect, rip/rsp redirect) gates it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
